    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple first-person exploration game where your main goal is to find specific items listed in your quest log.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item-Finding Exploration Gameplay</strong>: Begin your journey deep underwater and explore the dark ocean environment to locate quest items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Underwater Atmosphere</strong>: The game starts at night, making the surroundings quite dark and creating a mysterious, immersive mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flashlight with Limited Battery</strong>: You have a flashlight to help you see, but its battery is limited \u2014 use it wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow Movement for Careful Exploration</strong>: Movement is intentionally slow to encourage methodical searching and create a more tense experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but Focused Playtime</strong>: The game offers a compact gameplay experience, perfect for players who enjoy calm, atmospheric exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not meant to be difficult or fast-paced. It's about slowing down, observing your surroundings, and finding hidden objects in a quiet, moody environment. Will you be able to complete the quest?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple first-person exploration game where your main goal is to find specific items listed in your quest log.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item-Finding Exploration Gameplay</strong>: Begin your journey deep underwater and explore the dark ocean environment to locate quest items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Underwater Atmosphere</strong>: The game starts at night, making the surroundings quite dark and creating a mysterious, immersive mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flashlight with Limited Battery</strong>: You have a flashlight to help you see, but its battery is limited \u2014 use it wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow Movement for Careful Exploration</strong>: Movement is intentionally slow to encourage methodical searching and create a more tense experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but Focused Playtime</strong>: The game offers a compact gameplay experience, perfect for players who enjoy calm, atmospheric exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not meant to be difficult or fast-paced. It's about slowing down, observing your surroundings, and finding hidden objects in a quiet, moody environment. Will you be able to complete the quest?</p>",
    "short_description": "A first-person exploration game set in the deep, dark ocean. Use your flashlight carefully, avoid hidden dangers, and find the items you need to complete your quest.",
